{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636420/extras/GrassGif03.gif?t=1748349669\" /><strong>Make your Move, a combination and strategy roguelike</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> In Make your Move you must fight the shadows and defeat the void, for this you have a unique ability to generate cubes and rotate them to get different combinations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636420/extras/RotatingCubeGif02.gif?t=1748349669\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636420/extras/CloudGif.gif?t=1748349669\" /><strong>Your game, your decisions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every game you play in Make your Move is different, with a randomised system, when you start it generates randomly, map, objects, equipment, enemies. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636420/extras/RNGGif02.gif?t=1748349669\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636420/extras/GifChest.gif?t=1748349669\" /><strong>Every cube counts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With <strong>100</strong> different types of cubes each with their own unique effects, unlock them all to advance, improve your stats and make new combinations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636420/extras/DiscoverCubesGif02.gif?t=1748349669\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636420/extras/BookGif.gif?t=1748349669\" /><strong>Build your own class, variety to choose from</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">14 types of stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">15 different classes, each with their own abilities and passives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Weapons and equipment, upgrades, temporary items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine all of these to play each game differently to suit your strategy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636420/extras/ItemsGif.gif?t=1748349669\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636420/extras/DarkGif.gif?t=1748349669\" /><strong>Semi-automatic turn-based combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combat is based on a classic turn-based system, where each round generates turns based on speed. Each turn awards stamina points to the selected skill, which can be swapped at any time to create different combinations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636420/extras/CombatGif.gif?t=1748349669\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636420/extras/PlayerTyGif.gif?t=1748349669\" /><strong>Thanks for playing Make your Move!</stron